{title: Ninety-Eight Souls}
{subtitle: Ezra 2:16; Nehemiah 7:21; Ezra 2:42; Nehemiah 7:45; 10:17}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m7] | ×9

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
In the name of the Father, the [G#m7]Son, [C#7]and the Holy Spirit. A[D#m7]men.
From Babylon we walk [G#m7]away
Fol[C#7]lowing Zerubbabel's call
[D#m7]Nine-ty-[Bmaj7]eight of Ater's line
[F#maj7]From [G#m7]Hezekiah we stand tall
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Nine-[D#m7]ty-[Bmaj7]eight souls come home
To [F#maj7]the gate [G#m7]where we be[A#m7]long
Guarding [D#m7]the temple door
The covenant seal [G#m7]is [C#]strong
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Among the gatekeepers [D#m7]we stand
Shallum and Ater side [G#m7]by [C#]side
Talmon and Akkub keep watch
[D#m7]Ha[Bmaj7]tita and Shobai [F#maj7]a[G#m7]bide
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Nine-ty-eight souls come home
[D#m7]To [Bmaj7]the gate where we be[F#maj7]long
Guard[G#m7]ing the tem[A#m7]ple door
The [D#m7]co[Bmaj7]venant seal is strong
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
A[F#maj7]doni[G#m7]jah and Bigvai sign
Adin [D#m7]joins [Bmaj7]the holy line
We pledge [F#maj7]to fol[G#m7]low God's law
In [A#m7]this restored and [D#m7]sa[Bmaj7]cred place
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Nine-ty-eight names in [F#maj7]the [G#m7]list
Faithful [A#m7]in the qui[D#m7]et dust
{end_of_verse}

